{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5", "id": "msg_011Cf3JJDhpQspoiePX9brLx", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**1.**\n\nAll four lenses \u2014 ux, bugs, onboarding, content \u2014 score a **Mode A** (product journey) capture, and capture is separate from scoring. One persona means one persona/goal pair, so one browser traversal produces one evidence folder, and the four lens agents each read that same folder afterwards.\n\nThe multiplier on traversals is modes and personas, not lenses:\n- A second persona would add a traversal.\n- A `technical` (Mode B), `seo`/`aeo` (Mode C), or `compare` (Mode D) objective would add non-persona captures, since those drive the browser differently \u2014 no session, no persona.\n- Adding a fifth Mode A lens would add zero."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 8371, "cache_read_input_tokens": 11688, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 8371}, "output_tokens": 2, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "97c8b72f-572d-4624-9296-09ecb04453df", "uuid": "fbeace4e-4181-4b13-a68c-d3cbc0224558", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T12:03:34.184Z", "request_id": "req_011Cf3JJCpUt5nqma1z8Ajwj"}
